  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:10.420" end="00:16.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(dwilly, I'm scared)</p>
      <p begin="00:16.080" end="00:17.580" ttm:agent="v1">Walk up out the door</p>
      <p begin="00:17.430" end="00:19.030" ttm:agent="v1">Left a note up on my dresser</p>
      <p begin="00:19.030" end="00:22.150" ttm:agent="v1">They tell me everyday that life is on its way to better</p>
      <p begin="00:22.150" end="00:25.360" ttm:agent="v1">But I cant seem to shake the fact that I've been getting fed up</p>
      <p begin="00:25.360" end="00:28.470" ttm:agent="v1">That's why my mind is drifting to the thought of a Beretta</p>
      <p begin="00:28.470" end="00:32.200" ttm:agent="v1">Got the 35 rippin' and the 45 bang</p>
      <p begin="00:32.200" end="00:35.280" ttm:agent="v1">Subwoofer knockin' I'm rockin' that mothafucka' for a bag uh</p>
      <p begin="00:35.280" end="00:36.820" ttm:agent="v1">Comin' from nothin' I made it to riches</p>
      <p begin="00:36.820" end="00:38.320" ttm:agent="v1">I tell em to throw out the rags</p>
      <p begin="00:38.130" end="00:39.630" ttm:agent="v1">Huh</p>
      <p begin="00:38.480" end="00:40.080" ttm:agent="v1">'Member when I was just washin' them dishes</p>
      <p begin="00:40.080" end="00:42.010" ttm:agent="v1">And now I be poppin' 'em tags</p>
      <p begin="00:42.010" end="00:43.510" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch I'm back with a black mask</p>
      <p begin="00:43.400" end="00:44.900" ttm:agent="v1">Any mothafucka' wanna back track</p>
      <p begin="00:44.470" end="00:46.040" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch I been about it, gonna put em in a body bag</p>
      <p begin="00:46.040" end="00:47.540" ttm:agent="v1">Body back tucked</p>
      <p begin="00:46.860" end="00:48.360" ttm:agent="v1">In a black van</p>
      <p begin="00:47.330" end="00:48.830" ttm:agent="v1">Ride for the gang until I-</p>
      <p begin="00:48.350" end="00:51.260" ttm:agent="v1">Till I die, bitch I'm riding for the gang</p>
      <p begin="00:51.260" end="00:54.380" ttm:agent="v1">Tell 'em fuck the money and I tell 'em fuck the fame</p>
      <p begin="00:54.380" end="00:57.780" ttm:agent="v1">Stayin' on the low, bitch they stayin' on my case</p>
      <p begin="00:57.780" end="01:00.460" ttm:agent="v1">Every day I wake up put a mask upon my face</p>
      <p begin="01:00.460" end="01:01.960" ttm:agent="v1">Til' I-</p>
      <p begin="01:01.180" end="01:04.060" ttm:agent="v1">Till I die, bitch I'm riding for the gang</p>
      <p begin="01:04.060" end="01:07.120" ttm:agent="v1">Tell 'em fuck the money and I tell 'em fuck the fame</p>
      <p begin="01:07.120" end="01:10.510" ttm:agent="v1">Stayin' on the low, bitch they stayin' on my case</p>
      <p begin="01:10.510" end="01:13.360" ttm:agent="v1">Every day I wake up put a mask upon my face</p>
      <p begin="01:13.360" end="01:14.860" ttm:agent="v1">Aye</p>
      <p begin="01:14.140" end="01:15.780" ttm:agent="v1">.45 make em fly like doves</p>
      <p begin="01:15.780" end="01:17.280" ttm:agent="v1">In the spotlight, bitch that's us</p>
      <p begin="01:17.250" end="01:18.900" ttm:agent="v1">Lettin' off shots with the men I trust</p>
      <p begin="01:18.900" end="01:20.420" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch I'm smoking that thrax 'til the come up</p>
      <p begin="01:20.420" end="01:21.920" ttm:agent="v1">I think it's that time of the month</p>
      <p begin="01:21.490" end="01:22.990" ttm:agent="v1">Money come in, then I'm pilin' it up</p>
      <p begin="01:22.740" end="01:24.240" ttm:agent="v1">Stay back if u ain't ridin' with us</p>
      <p begin="01:24.090" end="01:25.590" ttm:agent="v1">Five in the mornin'</p>
      <p begin="01:24.860" end="01:26.740" ttm:agent="v1">I'm letting off shells like I need more miles in the bus</p>
      <p begin="01:26.740" end="01:28.240" ttm:agent="v1">And the bank got stacked</p>
      <p begin="01:27.770" end="01:29.270" ttm:agent="v1">I get paid to relax</p>
      <p begin="01:28.780" end="01:30.350" ttm:agent="v1">One last puff and I'm fadin' to black</p>
      <p begin="01:30.350" end="01:31.960" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck 'round bitch, get a fade wit a MAC</p>
      <p begin="01:31.960" end="01:33.460" ttm:agent="v1">In a three story crib I ain't pay for the rent</p>
      <p begin="01:33.070" end="01:34.570" ttm:agent="v1">Ge- getting high</p>
      <p begin="01:34.060" end="01:35.560" ttm:agent="v1">Smoking swishers</p>
      <p begin="01:34.860" end="01:36.420" ttm:agent="v1">Don't got time for y'all bitches</p>
      <p begin="01:36.420" end="01:37.920" ttm:agent="v1">Let it bang</p>
      <p begin="01:37.290" end="01:38.790" ttm:agent="v1">Shit get wicked</p>
      <p begin="01:38.030" end="01:39.530" ttm:agent="v1">Boy a stain</p>
      <p begin="01:38.750" end="01:40.250" ttm:agent="v1">He washed like dishes</p>
      <p begin="01:39.540" end="01:42.480" ttm:agent="v1">Till I die, bitch I'm riding for the gang</p>
      <p begin="01:42.480" end="01:45.530" ttm:agent="v1">Tell 'em fuck the money and I tell 'em fuck the fame</p>
      <p begin="01:45.530" end="01:48.920" ttm:agent="v1">Stayin' on the low, bitch they stayin' on my case</p>
      <p begin="01:48.920" end="01:51.540" ttm:agent="v1">Every day I wake up put a mask upon my face</p>
      <p begin="01:51.540" end="01:53.040" ttm:agent="v1">Til' I-</p>
      <p begin="01:52.300" end="01:55.290" ttm:agent="v1">Till I die, bitch I'm riding for the gang</p>
      <p begin="01:55.290" end="01:58.370" ttm:agent="v1">Tell 'em fuck the money and I tell 'em fuck the fame</p>
      <p begin="01:58.370" end="02:01.720" ttm:agent="v1">Stayin' on the low, bitch they stayin' on my case</p>
      <p begin="02:01.720" end="02:05.430" ttm:agent="v1">Every day I wake up put a mask upon my face</p>
